  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Women - WPS and Covid-19 Relief in Mindanao</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is designed to deliver rapid response to women and communities in the post-conflict Bangsamoro region; recognising that the leadership of women and gender-responsive actions are critical to (i) effective recovery and revitalisation from COVID-19; (ii) the maintenance of peace and social cohesion in BARMM in the face of the pandemic, and the forward trajectory of the Bangsamoro peace transition.</narrative>
  </description>
